WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.280
Forms: the forms customers fill in a chat or through a link, like intake, booking or order, with their fields and their look.

2
00:00:10.826 --> 00:00:20.930
See the existing forms, and make your own copy of a ready form with Duplicate as editable. Or create a New form, and add questions from Fields.

3
00:00:21.478 --> 00:00:25.760
In Form design, set the colours and look of the form page.

4
00:00:26.306 --> 00:00:37.300
Put the form in a flow or an automation; the answers are saved on that customer's record. Keep forms short: every extra question lowers how many people finish.
